      format: 'sanitized-html',
      html: '<p>s of service apply to all products and services provided by <a href="/en/home/">Sova</a>. They are essential for every business to understand when using our offerings.</p><p>At Sova, we place great importance on clear and transparent collaboration with our clients. These terms have been carefully developed and continuously improved to ensure mutual understanding and effective cooperation. By using our services, we kindly ask that you comply with the terms outlined herein.</p><h2>What Are Sova’s Terms of Service?</h2><p>Sova’s Terms of Service outline the commitments and conditions for using the products and services we provide to our clients. These terms serve as the foundation for effective and long-term cooperation between Sova and businesses or personal brand developers partnering with us.</p><p>If a client does not agree with the provisions and regulations stated in these terms, either party reserves the right to terminate the agreement. In such cases, Sova also retains the right to claim compensation for any damages resulting from non-compliance with the stated rules.</p><h2>Detailed Terms of Service – Sova</h2> <h3>Your Relationship with Sova</h3><p>Your company, business, or personal brand is considered a valued client and partner in Sova’s development journey. We highly respect all clients, and every agreement is carefully drafted and signed with professionalism and transparency.</p><p>The relationship between you and Sova is a partnership for mutual growth. Sova provides website-related solutions and associated services, which you access according to the terms and fees stated in the signed contract.</p><h3>Terms of Paid Services</h3><p>By signing a service agreement with Sova, you are granted full rights to use the services specified in the contract.</p><p>Our dedicated team will support you throughout your service usage, helping resolve any issues to ensure optimal performance and user experience.</p><p>As a client, you are required to use the services strictly for the development of your brand’s website and within the agreed-upon scope. Under no circumstances are you permitted to resell or redistribute Sova’s products or services to third parties in any form.</p><h3>Terms of Free Services</h3><p>When using Sova’s free services, you will have access to the full set of tools as advertised and publicly disclosed on our official website.</p><p>However, free services are not universally granted and are not exempt from copyright considerations. Clients are expected to respect and maintain intellectual property rights associated with these services.</p><p>If there is any indication of unauthorized copying, redistribution, or commercial use of Sova’s products or content by a third party, we reserve the right to immediately suspend the provision of free services and take appropriate enforcement actions.</p><h2>Service Usage Duration Terms</h2><p>According to our Terms of Service, the duration of product and service availability provided by Sova is defined as follows:</p><ul><li>For paid products and services, usage duration is based on the timeline agreed upon in the signed contract between both parties. Services may be renewed if a new agreement is signed or an extension of the existing agreement is mutually accepted.</li><li>For free products and services, availability is based on the time period publicly announced via Sova’s communication channels. This period may be adjusted based on company operations. Any changes will be announced on our official platforms for your timely awareness.</li></ul><h2>Handling of Terms Violation</h2><p>Sova outlines clear policies for handling violations of our Terms of Service:</p><ul><li>Any unauthorized modifications to products or services without Sova’s prior approval will result in the termination of the contract and the suspension of services.</li><li>Selling or distributing Sova’s products to third parties without written consent is considered a violation of intellectual property rights. Sova reserves the right to pursue legal action against such infringement.</li><li>During service usage, Sova retains full authority over core product content and reserves the right to make changes at its discretion.</li></ul><h2>Conclusion</h2><p>This document outlines the key terms and conditions for using Sova’s products and services. Businesses, companies, and personal brand developers are strongly encouraged to review and understand these provisions to ensure a smooth and long-lasting partnership.</p><p>Sova sincerely thanks you and values your continued cooperation.</p>',
